    start "2026-10-30"
    ended "2026-10-30"
    source "docs/decisions.md"
  decision
    question "On which operating systems does CI run?"
    decider "Maintainers"
    choice "Ubuntu for every pull request into main; Ubuntu, Windows and macOS for every push to main, including the native qualification shards."
    rationale "Path and line-ending bugs show up on Windows and macOS; running them on main keeps pull requests fast."

